        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.172,
            0.709,
            0.193
          ],
          "content": "1. Compute these products using the suggested identity."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.195,
            0.558,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": "(i) $4 6 ^ { 2 }$ using Identity 1A for $( a + b ) ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.22,
            0.672,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $3 9 7 \\times 4 0 3$ using Identity 1C for $( a + b )   ( a - b )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.244,
            0.556,
            0.264
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $9 1 ^ { 2 }$ using Identity 1B for $( a - b ) ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.268,
            0.649,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": "(iv) $4 3 \\times 4 5$ using Identity 1C for $( a + b )   ( a - b )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.294,
            0.367,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** (i) $\\begin{array} { l } { 4 6 ^ { 2 } = ( 4 0 + 6 ) ^ { 2 } } \\\\ { \\quad = 2 1 1 6 } \\end{array}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.337,
            0.509,
            0.377
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $\\begin{aligned}397 \\times 403 &= (400 - 3)(400 + 3) \\\\&= 159991\\end{aligned}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.381,
            0.379,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $\\begin{array} { c } { 9 1 ^ { 2 } = ( 1 0 0 - 9 ) ^ { 2 } } \\\\ { = 8 2 8 1 } \\end{array}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.425,
            0.476,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": "(iv) 43 × 45 = (44 – 1) (44 + 1) = 1935"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.476,
            0.845,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": "2. Use either a suitable identity or the distributive property to find each of the following products."
